# DUSKLING M4, CROW'S PERCH (room 4): the crow's perch: a thorn patch, a gulper on a post and a wasp.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
hold LEFT+A 7
hold A 25
wait 2
expect room == 5

